============================================================
                    VIPTO SELLER
                   PRIVACY POLICY
============================================================

Last Updated: July 2026

Welcome to Vipto Seller. Your privacy is important to us.
This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect,
how we use it, how we protect it, and the choices you have
when using the Vipto Seller application.

Vipto Seller is designed to help local shop owners upload
products, receive customer availability requests, and manage
their stores digitally. By using the application, you agree
to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.


------------------------------------------------------------
1. ABOUT VIPTO SELLER
------------------------------------------------------------

Vipto Seller is a marketplace application developed to
connect local businesses with nearby customers.

The application allows sellers to:

- Create a store profile
- Upload product images
- Manage product listings
- Respond to customer availability requests

At this stage, Vipto Seller is an MVP (Minimum Viable Product).
Some features may change or expand in future updates.


------------------------------------------------------------
2. INFORMATION WE COLLECT
------------------------------------------------------------

To provide our services, Vipto Seller collects only the
information necessary for operating the application.


SELLER INFORMATION

When you register as a seller, we may collect:

- Store owner's name
- Mobile phone number
- Store name
- Store category
- Store address
- Geographic location (latitude and longitude)
- Store verification status
- Account creation date

This information is stored securely in Firebase Firestore.


PRODUCT INFORMATION

When uploading products, we collect:

- Product images
- Product name
- Product category
- Product price
- Upload timestamp
- Store identifier

Images uploaded through the application are securely stored
using Cloudinary.


AVAILABILITY REQUESTS

When customers request product availability, we store:

- Customer phone number
- Product ID
- Shop ID
- Request status
- Request creation time
- Response time

These requests help sellers respond whether a product is
available.


------------------------------------------------------------
3. LOCATION INFORMATION
------------------------------------------------------------

Vipto Seller requests your device location during store setup.

Your location is used only to:

- Register your shop location
- Help customers discover nearby stores
- Improve local product visibility
- Support future map-based features

We do not continuously track your location in the background.

Location is collected only when required for store
registration or when you choose to update your store location.


------------------------------------------------------------
4. CAMERA AND GALLERY ACCESS
------------------------------------------------------------

The application requests permission to access your camera
and photo gallery.

These permissions are used only for:

- Capturing product images
- Selecting existing product photos
- Uploading products to your store

Images are uploaded only after you choose to upload them.

The application never captures photos or videos without
your knowledge.


------------------------------------------------------------
5. STORAGE OF IMAGES
------------------------------------------------------------

Product images uploaded by sellers are stored using Cloudinary,
a secure cloud image hosting service.

Cloudinary stores only the images you choose to upload.

Images are displayed inside the application so customers
can browse products.


------------------------------------------------------------
6. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION
------------------------------------------------------------

The information collected is used for the following purposes:

- Creating your seller account
- Displaying your store profile
- Publishing your products
- Allowing customers to discover your shop
- Processing availability requests
- Improving application performance
- Providing customer support
- Preventing misuse of the platform

We do not sell your personal information.


------------------------------------------------------------
7. FIREBASE SERVICES
------------------------------------------------------------

Vipto Seller uses Google Firebase services including:

- Cloud Firestore
- Firebase Core

Firebase securely stores application data and helps
synchronize information across devices.

Firebase may process data according to Google's Privacy Policy.


------------------------------------------------------------
8. THIRD-PARTY SERVICES
------------------------------------------------------------

The application currently uses the following third-party
services:

- Google Firebase
- Cloudinary

These services process information only to provide
application functionality.

Each service has its own privacy policy and security practices.


------------------------------------------------------------
9. DATA SECURITY
------------------------------------------------------------

We take reasonable technical and administrative measures
to protect your information.

These include:

- Secure cloud databases
- HTTPS encrypted communication
- Restricted database access
- Secure image hosting

While we strive to protect your data, no online service
can guarantee absolute security.


------------------------------------------------------------
10. DATA RETENTION
------------------------------------------------------------

Your information is stored while your account remains active.

If you stop using Vipto Seller, your data may continue to be
stored for operational, legal, or security purposes unless
you request deletion where applicable.


------------------------------------------------------------
